3433-		/*  The load succeeded. Widen the single to double.
3434-		    #305: through ppc_single_widen(), because the value domain
3435-		    cannot carry a NaN -- interpret reports only THAT a pattern
3436-		    is a NaN, and the store canonicalizes every one of them to
3437-		    all-ones, so a guest's qNaN 0xffc00001 used to arrive in the
3438-		    register as 0x7fffffffffffffff: wrong sign, wrong payload.
3439-		    Finite values still travel the (exact, #303-verified) value
3440-		    path inside the helper.  */
